  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed issue with handling KeepWithNext inside multi-column sections in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with 'align' attribute overriding 'text-align' CSS property in HTML reader.\nFixed issue with EMF Plus records in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with rendering SVG Picture.\nFixed issue with nested merge range inside IF Field.\nFixed issue with OleObject OleObject preview image in DOCX writer.\nFixed issue with banded TableRow formatting in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with empty TableCell in RTF reader.\nFixed issue with blocked resource downloading in HTML reader.\nFixed issue with counting words in bullet lists.\nFixed issue with BlockContentControl inside Note in DOCX reader.\nFixed issue with checking for ignored surrogate characters in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with missing fonts on macOS.\nAdded support for PageSetup.GridMode, PageSetup.CharactersPerLine, and PageSetup.LinesPerPage.\nFixed issue with invalid style type in DOCX reader.",
